{"title": "Death Burst: Cold", "pageid": 22273, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Death_Burst:_Cold", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp/300px-Generic_Cold.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp/300px-Generic_Cold.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Death Burst: Cold</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Mephit\" title=\"Ice Mephit\">Ice Mephit</a> Passive Feature. If the Ice Mephit dies, it automatically explodes, dealing cold damage to all nearby creatures. This damage is less than if it willingly explodes with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Cold)\" title=\"Death Burst (Cold)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/38px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/50px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst (Cold)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Cold)\" title=\"Death Burst (Cold)\">Death Burst (Cold)</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the mephit dies, it explodes in a burst of ice that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage to all creatures within 2 m (7 ft). \n</p><p>On a successful save, the creatures still take half damage.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Mephit\" title=\"Ice Mephit\">Ice Mephit</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205904\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 970/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5791/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3393/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnst